{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "04ced3db56e7b7f4631e2e43dadd1c520da8a5996f8cfbbba30b1fcc856fdc83", "ja": "ライブMC　～どこにいても届くように～", "zh": "演唱会主持词　～无论身在何方都能传达到～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5a2258d03dee27aaa77c03fcfe3b911c795a9357da10fc953ea4a2a1a6dee1ea", "ja": "千早達の歌が終わり、客席からは大歓声。M\nCに入っても盛り上がりは衰えない。会場の\n外まで呼びかける奈緒に、突っ込む可憐。フ\nォローする紗代子。息の合った掛け合いに笑\nいも起こり、ライブは次のステージへ。", "zh": "千早等人的歌声结束后，观众席爆发出热烈的欢呼。\n进入M\nC环节后，现场的气氛依然高涨。奈绪向会场外也发出呼喊，可怜则吐槽起来。纱代子在一旁帮忙圆场。配合默契的互动引发阵阵笑声，演唱会迈向了下一个舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "fc29c547e1d061dde64dfa29e45800d7a185551b1287d73eb4fd91c178dcc2e5", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "af8a8200c300410a7120a942e1e9dcb76e99a1d4df903eb9fe5ef5f9a82a1edd", "ja": "みなさん、私たちの歌を聞いてくださって、\nありがとうございました！", "zh": "大家，非常感谢你们\n来听我们的歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "62a737ad228a0ff145c262ef213d5f2c14a51b91c34c7431a63c734718323852", "ja": "きょ、今日は、記念公演を迎えられた感謝の気持ちを、\nたくさん込めて……う、歌いました～！", "zh": "今、今天能迎来纪念公演，我把满满的感激之情……呜、都唱进歌里了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "664443ee8603efd41f78152c406a6c1ccf3598104909ff878ae660e4447d4ee7", "ja": "私たちの気持ち、感じてもらえましたか～！？", "zh": "大家有感受到我们的心意吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "0e9468c046b7f38cc0ebb1945e981767c69f23a38328e57225e6543ebdc0422b", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアァァァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "ffae35a8559a3ab0b323bdad8ad4a5efcb87c22cb3963e7c426798e26419c301", "ja": "ありがとーーー！　いや～、楽しいなあ。\n野外ライブって、なんやめっちゃ解放感あるし！", "zh": "谢谢——！哎呀～真开心啊。\n户外演唱会就是感觉特别放松！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "d8b63ad6054546534aa020dd6b4e7c2825ff782e9c83a2876b1091a5589772af", "ja": "そうだね奈緒ちゃん。もしかしたら、\n会場の外にいる人たちも、歌を聞いてくれてるかも！", "zh": "是啊，奈绪。说不定，场外的人们也正在听我们的歌呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "6ab9e12ee5a53fc296a0daca3ed506c9ab1db77f65809bf7df296194e8cf2810", "ja": "そ、そう思うと、ちょっぴり、\n恥ずかしい気もしますね……えへへ。", "zh": "这、这么一想，感觉也有点害羞呢……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "9f64a5c68016b0e43b937cd15afbdae7b255398fed6c4bcb053078f649875bd2", "ja": "でも、通りすがりに、歌を楽しんで\nもらえているとしたら……うれしいです。", "zh": "不过，要是路过的人也能享受到歌声……我会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "5f35e82fa7da4006ecf95b00e411053a84bec8ab229330a291d383baa3763c04", "ja": "会場の外のみんな～～！　聞こえてますか～～！\nまいどおおきに～～！！", "zh": "会场外的各位～～！听得见吗～～！\n多谢大家一直以来的支持～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff1880efcc7dc94a59a9f27fbc2197f91801e3906a253c830efe2c9081af2e74", "ja": "奈緒さん！？\nそ、それはホントに、恥ずかしいです～！", "zh": "奈绪！？\n这、这真的很让人害羞啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1011_audience", "source_sha256": "086c03085ccb3ed5a72842d66177965a37ac18bd311d66f575169d0155699079", "ja": "あはははは！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "25853aeed8e2607be70d3e8079eed210185d53f73a5af03c49213a41d5ca5717", "ja": "ふふっ♪　どこにいても、楽しんでもらえるように。\nこの後も精一杯、気持ちを込めて歌っていきますので！", "zh": "呵呵♪ 无论身在何处，我都希望能让大家享受其中。\n接下来我也会竭尽全力，倾注心意歌唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_06_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "c69f2ac366cba9248bcc66b1000090488d8f5b10c596350150c77fa8c16f8f91", "ja": "ええ。ライブはまだまだ、これからです。\n引き続き、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "嗯。演唱会还远未结束，接下来才是精彩的开始。\n之后也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
